    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Kemurikusa",
        "jpn": "ケムリクサ"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "A story about three sisters struggling to survive in a desolate world surrounded by decaying buildings and red fog. The story revolves around Rin, a girl with an updo. There's also Ritsu, the big sister who has cat ears and is always calm, and Rina, the innocent, cheerful one dressed in a maid's costume. Just what is it that these sisters are after in this mysterious world?",
        "jpn": "赤い霧に包まれた、\r\n荒廃した建造物に囲まれた人気の無い世界を舞台に\r\n３人の姉妹が生き抜く物語。\r\n物語の中心的人物でまとめ髪の特徴的なりん、\r\n猫耳でいつもおっとりしているお姉さんキャラのりつ、\r\nメイド調の服に身を包み天真爛漫なムードメーカーりな。\r\n謎多き世界で\r\nこの姉妹が目指すものは一体…"
    },
